WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Browse curated shelves in the desktop feed.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Hover a cover for a preview and its actions.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Click a cover to open game details.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Explore the screenshot gallery.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Browse your whole library in All games.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Change the library sort to Recently played.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Compare themes in Appearance settings.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Use F11 to switch to fullscreen. Move between games.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Move vertically to another curated shelf.

